# SECURITY

Cursor must never:
- expose secrets
- read .env files unnecessarily
- commit secrets
- bypass auth
- bypass admin approvals

Forbidden:
- .env
- .env.*
- .vercel/**
- secrets/**
- private/**
- *.pem
- *.key
- *.crt
- *.p12

---

# DEVELOPMENT RULES

Preserve:
- existing auth
- database contracts
- API routes
- admin gating
- workflow orchestration

Avoid:
- recursive effects
- unstable dependencies
- uncontrolled polling
- duplicate scheduled jobs
- race conditions

